R","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946665500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950183572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107180#issuecomment-2950183572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107180","id":2950183572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v2DqU","user":{"login":"ianilychh1","id":130171767,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8JDdw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130171767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1","html_url":"https://github.com/ianilychh1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T18:49:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T19:17:03Z","body":"OK, linux-editor-mono, and the only error i get is:   ERROR: drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:1795 - Parameter \"texture\" is null.\n\nAnd the issue is still not resolved.\n\nI think it has to do the way it bakes lightmaps REAL fast, like it baked REAL fast with the Intel HD Graphics 400. It seems like a very fast optimization that sacrifices the quality of LightmapGI.\n\nUpdate: Directional no longer dosen't crash, but it produces a lot of errors:\n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:889 - Condition \"p_layers[i]->get_format() != valid_format\" is true.\n  ERROR: Attempting to use an uninitialized RID\n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:1378 - Parameter \"tex_from\" is null.\n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:1795 - Parameter \"texture\" is null.\n\nAnother update: When baking it again, the entire lightmap is blank, like everything is black.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8837232f-8804-4bdc-9765-b16845b3bcb8)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950183572/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950524310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107180#issuecomment-2950524310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107180","id":2950524310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v3W2W","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T19:40:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T19:40:11Z","body":"> I think it has to do the way it bakes lightmaps REAL fast, like it baked REAL fast with the Intel HD Graphics 400. It seems like a very fast optimization that sacrifices the quality of LightmapGI.\n\nThis is likely because lightmap baking failed early on in the process, since it couldn't allocate the texture for baking in the first place. There is no such optimization in place that would sacrifice quality depending on the GPU used.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950524310/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960640360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107180#issuecomment-2960640360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107180","id":2960640360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wd8lo","user":{"login":"ianilychh1","id":130171767,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8JDdw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130171767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1","html_url":"https://github.com/ianilychh1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianilychh1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u